-YAD"],["to the airport, please","ба фурудгоҳ, лутфан","bah foo-rood-GOH loot-FAN"],["stop here, please","дар ин ҷо истед, лутфан","dar een JO ees-TED loot-FAN"]]},{"id":"eating-out","title":"Eating out","items":[["a table for two, please","мизи дунафара, лутфан","mee-zee doo-nah-fah-RAH loot-FAN"],["the menu, please","меню, лутфан","meh-NYOO loot-FAN"],["I will have this","ман инро мегирам","man een-RO meh-gee-RAM"],["water, please","об, лутфан","ob loot-FAN"],["the bill, please","ҳисоб, лутфан","hee-SOB loot-FAN"],["it is delicious","хеле болаззат аст","khe-LEH bo-laz-ZAT ast"],["I am hungry","ман гурусна ҳастам","man goo-roos-NAH has-TAM"],["I am thirsty","ман ташна ҳастам","man tash-NAH has-TAM"],["I am vegetarian","ман гиёҳхор ҳастам","man gee-yoh-KHOR has-TAM"],["I am allergic to nuts","ман ба чормағз аллергия дорам","man bah chor-MAGHZ al-ler-GEE-yah do-RAM"],["no meat, please","бе гӯшт, лутфан","beh GOOSHT loot-FAN"],["another one, please","боз як дона, лутфан","boz yak do-NAH loot-FAN"]]},{"id":"shopping","title":"Shopping","items":[["how much is this?","ин чанд пул аст?","een chand POOL ast"],["it is too expensive","хеле қимат аст","khe-LEH kee-MAT ast"],["do you have a smaller size?","андозаи хурдтараш ҳаст?","an-do-zah-ee khoord-tah-RASH hast"],["I am just looking","танҳо мебинам","tan-HO meh-bee-NAM"],["I will take it","ман инро мегирам","man een-RO meh-gee-RAM"],["can I pay by card?","бо корт пардохт карда метавонам?","bo kort par-DOKHT kar-DAH meh-tah-vo-NAM"],["cash","пули нақд","poo-lee NAKD"],["a bag, please","халта, лутфан","khal-TAH loot-FAN"],["open","кушода","koo-sho-DAH"],["closed","баста","bas-TAH"]]},{"id":"hotel-and-travel","title":"Hotel and travel","items":[["I have a reservation","ман ҷой пешакӣ гирифтаам","man joy pe-shah-KEE gee-reef-tah-AM"],["a room for one night","як шаб ҳуҷра","yak SHAB hooj-RAH"],["what time is breakfast?","ношта соати чанд?","no-shtah so-ah-tee CHAND"],["the key, please","калид, лутфан","kah-LEED loot-FAN"],["is 